'''Robbie''' is a [[Robgoblins|robgoblin]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] that can be found at [[Camp Robbie]], located in the [[Greenwood Forest]]. Robbie, along with [[Chatty]], are the official mascots of ''[[Free Realms]]''.

Robbie is also an NPC [[Boss|boss]] in [[Bigfoot's Lair]], he used to wear the Bigfoot costume which come to attack the player in the [[Battles|battle]].

